    "description": "You share your considerable galactic knowledge to inform others' actions and decisions. Once per encounter, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>, if you succeed on a DC 25 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Knowledge_(Galactic_Lore)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Knowledge (Galactic Lore)\">Knowledge (Galactic Lore)</a> check, you enable one ally within 6 squares of you to reroll a failed <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> based <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Check\">Skill Check</a> (other than <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a>).",
